over your Google Cloud resource

00:00:30.450 --> 00:00:31.320
consumption.

00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:34.110
You can think of it like
closing your laptop.

00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:37.360
Head to the blog
for more details.

00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:40.690
As we continue our series on
health care and cybersecurity,

00:00:40.690 --> 00:00:44.230
