system can secure and preserve

00:00:50.980 --> 00:00:52.450
patient care and safety.

00:00:52.450 --> 00:00:54.640
Check out the blog
for further details

00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:57.100
and more about how health
care can strengthen

00:00:57.100 --> 00:01:00.520
